# ==========================================================
# Cursor Editing Rules — Fantasy Football ML Project
# ==========================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Cursor must follow all conventions defined in /ai/context/*
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# General rules
- Use pandas for all dataframe manipulation.
- PyTorch is the only approved ML framework.
- numpy is allowed for numerical ops, but never as a replacement for pandas DataFrames.

# Code structure
- Keep data loading and preprocessing under `data/` or `preprocessing/`
- Training code must remain under `ml/`
- No new dependencies without explicit justification in the patch

# Naming conventions
- Use descriptive variable names (e.g. `receiving_yards`)
- Comment tensor shapes in the model code where not immediately obvious

# Do Not Touch
- Files in `legacy/` unless explicitly requested
